Project Structure

virtual-tryon/
|-- templates/
|   |-- index.html  frontend
|-- uploads/        uploaded images
|-- README
|-- app.py          backend (flask)

Running the Application

1. Start the Flask server:
    python3 app.py

2. Open in a web browser:
    http://127.0.0.1:5000

3. Select an upper-body image in box 1
4. Select a cloth image in box 2
5. Click Generate Try-On
